_:r25b2 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "The work is Sun & Rain Works' conceptual designation connected to the consignment of lot 16 at Sotheby's Photographs, 2009; it is an assertion by the artist and is not recorded as a publicly witnessed performance." .
