_:r5b3 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "Eight Sentences On Metaconceptual Art" .
_:r5b3 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670> .
